    "description": "Project phase 04. Research report 15.0%",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">RMD301 · Assessment 6/7</span>\n<h2>Project phase 04. Research report</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14072 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">RMD301 · Đầu điểm 6/7</span>\n<h2>Project phase 04. Research report</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14072 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">15.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">in class and homework</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO5, CLO6</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">practical exercises</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">- From session 51 to 60<br>- Student present the research result with fulfilled studied requirements</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">Research Report - This phase focuses on synthesizing, writing, and presenting the research outcomes. Students are required to transform their research execution (Phases 01-02-03) into a structured, academic research report. The report must demonstrate a clear link between the research problem, methods, findings, and conclusions, while reflecting originality, critical thinking, and practical application in the field of visual arts and design.<br>- The student must finish the task and submit the result to the lecturer in time.<br>- The point of the task could be published to students at the end of the phase<br>- Individual work<br>Submit:<br>a. Research Proposal Report: .docx/PDF<br>b. Ai. Usage Log: File Format: .docx/PDF</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">A.i. Usage log: Students are encouraged to use it during their assignments. If used, an explanation must be submitted according to the following requirements: (State AI tools: Name, role, and stage of use; adhere to AI ethics and technical principles.<br>Analyze support: Specify the level of AI contribution (e.g., search, image generation, content editing, visualization).<br>Self-assess: Assess the balance between team/individual contributions and AI, ensuring humans play a central role.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 3 — PRESENTATION</li><li>Session 4 — PRESENTATION</li><li>Session 5 — PRESENTATION</li><li>Session 6 — PRESENTATION</li><li>Session 7 — PRESENTATION</li><li>Session 8 — PRESENTATION</li><li>Session 9 — PRESENTATION</li><li>Session 10 — PRESENTATION</li><li>Session 11 — PRESENTATION</li><li>Session 12 — PRESENTATION</li><li>Session 13 — PRESENTATION</li><li>Session 14 — PRESENTATION</li><li>Session 15 — PRESENTATION</li><li>Session 16 — PRESENTATION</li><li>Session 17 — PRESENTATION</li><li>Session 18 — PRESENTATION</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 3 — PRESENTATION</li><li>Buổi 4 — PRESENTATION</li><li>Buổi 5 — PRESENTATION</li><li>Buổi 6 — PRESENTATION</li><li>Buổi 7 — PRESENTATION</li><li>Buổi 8 — PRESENTATION</li><li>Buổi 9 — PRESENTATION</li><li>Buổi 10 — PRESENTATION</li><li>Buổi 11 — PRESENTATION</li><li>Buổi 12 — PRESENTATION</li><li>Buổi 13 — PRESENTATION</li><li>Buổi 14 — PRESENTATION</li><li>Buổi 15 — PRESENTATION</li><li>Buổi 16 — PRESENTATION</li><li>Buổi 17 — PRESENTATION</li><li>Buổi 18 — PRESENTATION</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
