    "content": "<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/RMD301/flm1/d10/001.webp\" alt=\"RMD301 · RMD Assessment Component · slide 1: 00. Assessment Component\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">RMD Assessment Component · slide 1/6</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>00. Assessment Component<br>12/7/2024<br>http://fpt.edu.vn<br>1</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/RMD301/flm1/d10/002.webp\" alt=\"RMD301 · RMD Assessment Component · slide 2: Student present the understanding and application of a part of theory\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">RMD Assessment Component · slide 2/6</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Student present the understanding and application of a part of  theory<br>Students choose a topic among the theory of the subject.<br>Student must read the textbook, research the chosen topic, and execute the presentation.<br>The time of the presentation depends on the topic chosen.<br>Group work<br>Presentation</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/RMD301/flm1/d10/003.webp\" alt=\"RMD301 · RMD Assessment Component · slide 3: Student conducts a design proposal applying design essentials\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">RMD Assessment Component · slide 3/6</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Student conducts a design proposal applying design essentials<br>Student must finish the task and submit the result to the lecturer in time.<br>Individual work<br>Project phase 01_Research proposal</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/RMD301/flm1/d10/004.webp\" alt=\"RMD301 · RMD Assessment Component · slide 4: Student creates a research plan based on the understanding of studied research methods\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">RMD Assessment Component · slide 4/6</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Student creates a research plan based on the understanding of studied research methods<br>Student must finish the task and submit the result to the lecturer in time.<br>Require student to finish phase 01 of the Project<br>Individual work<br>Project phase 02_Research planning</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/RMD301/flm1/d10/005.webp\" alt=\"RMD301 · RMD Assessment Component · slide 5: Student properly executes the planned research project\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">RMD Assessment Component · slide 5/6</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Student properly executes the planned research project<br>Student must finish the task and submit the result to the lecturer in time.<br>Require student to finish phase 02 of the Project<br>Individual work<br>Project phase 03_Research execution</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/RMD301/flm1/d10/006.webp\" alt=\"RMD301 · RMD Assessment Component · slide 6: Student present the research result with fulfilled studied requirements\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">RMD Assessment Component · slide 6/6</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Student present the research result with fulfilled studied requirements<br>Student must finish the task and submit the result to the lecturer in time.<br>Require student to finish phase 03 of the Project<br>Individual work<br>Project phase 04_Research report</p></div>"
